Hosting relevant files required for Sarawak's electoral redistricting purposes
The folder was renamed to Sarawak 2026 Redelineation
All the datasets were produced by TindakMalaysia Network Services PLT
*NOTICE OF UPDATE (20/8/2025)*
- Corrected the total electors for the various administrative Districts (Daerahs) and the Senarai_Daerah_Sarawak_Bilangan_Pengundi_2022 file was updated
*NOTICE OF UPDATE (9/1/2026)*
- Added Bahagian Bintulu relevant files
*NOTICE OF UPDATE (6/2/2026)*
- Added Bahagian Sibu relevant files
*NOTICE OF UPDATE (7/2/2026)*
- Added Bahagian Sri Aman relevant files
*NOTICE OF UPDATE (25/2/2026)*
- Removed Bahagian Sri Aman map file
- Added Bahagian Miri map file
*NOTICE OF UPDATE (3/2/2026)*
- Added updated Bahagian Sri Aman map file
*NOTICE OF UPDATE (3/4/2026)
- Replaced Kuching, Samarahan and Sibu Daerah Mengundi Map files
- Daerah Mengundis for each Division on the basis of Local Authority Areas (PBT) coverage for each Division
*NOTICE OF UPDATE (10/9/2026)
- Folder name was changed to Sarawak_2026_Example
- All 2022 relevant contents moved to new subfolder called Archived
- New zipped filed called SARAWAK_DM_2026_FOR_ERA.zip has been uploaded
- New file containing the distribution of voters by districts has been uploaded

